# Embereth Shieldbreaker // Battle Display: "Destroy target artifact" - with no artifact on the battlefield the Adventure
# cannot be cast at all (a spell with no legal target is not offered; the creature still is, the positive control on the
# same turn). Once Bot2 has a Sol Ring it can, and Bot2's Counterspell counters it: a countered Adventure is put into the
# graveyard, not exiled "on an adventure" (CR 715.4, 701.5), so the creature cannot be cast later from exile.

